    person("Arnaud", "Liehrmann", role = "aut"))
Description: Functions to test for differential expression between conditions at the tip of a phylogeny, combining Phylogenetic Comparative Methods implemented in `phylolm` with moderated statistics tailored for gene expression implemented in `limma`. 
